### Collect jobs from configured sources
POST http://localhost:8080/api/jobs/collect

### Retrieve collected jobs
GET http://localhost:8080/api/jobs

### Score job with ID 1 using Claude
POST http://localhost:8080/api/jobs/4/score

### Score up to 10 jobs taht have not been scored
POST http://localhost:8080/api/jobs/score-unscored?limit=10

### Get jobs meeting the minimum relevance score
GET http://localhost:8080/api/jobs/relevant

### Run scheduled job now
POST http://localhost:8080/api/workflow/run

### Send test email
POST http://localhost:8080/api/email/test